 total reallocation rate. In the fourth quarter of 2019, just over 50 percent of establishments either gained or lost jobs while the reallocation rate stood at a considerably lower 11.7 percent. This difference reflects the high rates of labor turnover at young and small establishments, which consist of a higher proportion of total establishments than of total employment.\n\nReall"
